Package: soryos-sound-theme
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: SoryOS Team <maintainers@soryos.local>
Depends: sound-theme-freedesktop
Description: SoryOS sound theme package
 This package defines the SoryOS desktop sound theme boundary. It currently
 inherits the freedesktop sound theme while SoryOS-specific sounds are designed
 and packaged.
Section: sound
Priority: optional
